M4-T99a_UI_Guards_And_Defines_v2.mdc
======================================

(同內容備援版本；若先前鏈接無法下載，請使用本檔案。)

Header
- 目的：為「開發用 HUD／Smart Console」加總開關與守門，避免與日後正式 UGUI 衝突；出包可一鍵關閉。
- 風險：低（新增 1 檔、修改 ≤2 檔）；不改核心流程、不搬家。
- 影響面：GameConfig 新增 devHudEnabled/smartConsoleEnabled；各 Dev HUD/Smart Console 在 Awake/Start 檢查開關。

Diff / Patch（節選）
1) ADD：Assets/DeepAbyssHive/Core/Config/GameConfigSO.UIFlags.cs
--- C# START ---
using UnityEngine;
namespace DeepAbyssHive.Core.Config
{
    public sealed partial class GameConfigSO : ScriptableObject
    {
        [Header("UI / Dev Tools")] public bool devHudEnabled = true;
        public bool smartConsoleEnabled = true;
    }
}
--- C# END ---

2) MODIFY：Assets/DeepAbyssHive/Core/Config/GameConfigBootLogger.cs
--- C# PATCH ---
private static void LogConfigOnLoad(GameConfigSO cfg)
{
    UnityEngine.Debug.Log($"[CONFIG] devHudEnabled={cfg.devHudEnabled} smartConsoleEnabled={cfg.smartConsoleEnabled}");
}
--- C# END PATCH ---

3) MODIFY：任何 Dev HUD / Smart Console Awake/Start
--- C# PATCH ---
using DeepAbyssHive.Core.Config;
private void Awake()
{
    var cfg = GameConfigProvider.Config;
    if (cfg != null && (/*HUD*/ cfg.devHudEnabled == false /*或 Console*/ || cfg.smartConsoleEnabled == false))
    { gameObject.SetActive(false); return; }
}
--- C# END PATCH ---

附錄：Scripting Define（可選）
- Player > Scripting Define Symbols：DEV_HUD / DEV_CONSOLE
- 以 #if DEV_HUD / #endif 包住 Dev HUD 腳本即可在正式包排除。
